<title>USA: Repsol stake held by BBV.</title>
<headline>Repsol stake held by BBV.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Bilbao Vizcaya S.A., a financial institution, said Wednesday it holds a 6.9 percent stake, or 20,823,586 shares, in Repsol SA.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Respol said its latest transactions, totalling 5,409,968, were completed by March 31 for a total US$575,980,388.</p>
<p>Spanish energy group Respol is based in Madrid.</p>
